    "description":   "Enforces automatic management of Windows local admin accounts using Microsoft LAPS via Intune. Sets password complexity, length, and expiration; backs up credentials to secure directory; automates account management tasks; and resets passwords after local admin use. Intended for 'NerdAdmin' profile across all assigned Windows endpoints. Use to comply with modern endpoint security best practices and CIS benchmark recommendations.",
